  "title": "Duke Energy Foundation completes more than $550,000 in grants to South Carolina organizations celebrating nation’s 250th birthday",
  "summary": "As America’s 250th anniversary approaches this Fourth of July, Duke Energy Foundation is providing more than $260,000 in grants to South Carolina organizations to help preserve local history and expand civic learning across the Palmetto State. This is the final round of the Foundation’s America250 initiative, completing a $550,000 investment in South Carolina tied to the nation’s anniversary focused on community-driven projects.",
